    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(1A) Without limiting the circumstances in which the CEO’s conduct or behaviour amounts to serious misconduct by the CEO...";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The Minister must terminate the CEO's appointment.";
